  FAMILY ANTICONCENTRATION_DICHOTOMY
  DIFFICULTY_DELTA NEW_STRUCTURE the target is replaced by an anticoncentration statement about the subset-sum distribution, which is a question about A rather than about its moments
  ROUTE_STATUS OPEN
  BLOCKER no proof yet that the concentrated branch contradicts sum-distinctness
  KILL_THEOREM NONE
  DELTA_STATUS UNCHECKED
  NEXT_REQUIREMENT GAP1

