LANGUAGE_DEFECT LD1
  EQUIVALENT_UNDER the current vocabulary, in which s.43.14 requires an adjudicating WORLD_RESULT to bind an instrument identity and s.43.31 requires an INCUMBENT to carry a crosscheck id
  SEPARATED_BY s.7 reserves INSTRUMENT and CROSSCHECK as header names and s.4 reads a reserved name as a header at any indent, so the only compliant utterance of either law detonates its own object into two
  INSTANCE three, all convicted HEADER_INDENTED by the estate blade: two-space INSTRUMENT I1 inside a WORLD_RESULT, two-space CROSSCHECK NONE inside an INCUMBENT which also stripped that object of its STATUS and fired INCUMBENT_AS_OPTIMUM downstream, and two-space INSTRUMENT inside the IMPLEMENTATION_AUDIT of s.43.21, whose own canonical example in the spec carries that exact line, so this defect report reproduced the defect it reports and the blade caught it
  PROPOSAL rename the two fields INSTRUMENT_ID and CROSSCHECK_ID, by the same repair that made FINAL_BOTTLENECK the package field in s.41.8 G12, and run the G12 collision audit over every field s.43 introduces

LANGUAGE_DEFECT LD2
  EQUIVALENT_UNDER the current vocabulary, in which s.12 lets a SOURCE_BIND declare any string as its SYMBOL
  SEPARATED_BY the binding blade decides use by a case-folded substring test of the symbol against the semantics text, so a one-letter symbol matches almost every English sentence and a bind for the letter n convicts every node in the round
  INSTANCE the first draft of this packet bound the symbols N and n and drew ten SOURCE_BINDING_BROKEN convictions, every one of them spurious; renaming the symbols interval_endpoint_N and cardinality_of_A cleared all ten without changing a single mathematical claim
  PROPOSAL require a SOURCE_BIND SYMBOL to be a token that cannot occur as a substring of ordinary English, or give the blade a word-boundary matcher; until then a one-letter bind is unwritable in practice and the register should say so

